---
---
<section class="py-20 bg-white relative">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Section Heading -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16 space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">
        Masih Menggunakan <span class="text-rose-600">Banyak Aplikasi</span> untuk Administrasi?
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 font-medium">
        Hari ini buka Word. Besok buka PDF Converter. Cari gambar di Google. Buat soal di website lain. Susun Modul Ajar secara manual. Lalu masih harus membuat ATP, TP, Prota, Prosem, dan Jurnal.
      </p>
      <p class="text-base text-gray-500 font-medium max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Semuanya memakan waktu yang sangat berharga. Padahal, waktu tersebut seharusnya bisa digunakan untuk fokus mengajar, beristirahat, atau berkumpul bersama keluarga tercinta.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 3 Pain Cards -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      
      <!-- Card 1: RPP Manual -->
      <div class="bg-rose-50/30 border border-rose-100 hover:border-rose-200 rounded-2xl p-8 hover-scale shadow-premium flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-rose-100 text-rose-600 flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-clock"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">RPP Manual = 3–4 Jam Terbuang</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed font-medium">
            Setiap minggu, guru menghabiskan waktu berharga hanya untuk mengetik format RPP yang sama secara berulang-ulang dari nol.
          </p>
        </div>
        <span class="text-xs text-rose-500 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mt-6 block">Melelahkan</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: Administrasi Menumpuk -->
      <div class="bg-amber-50/30 border border-amber-100 hover:border-amber-200 rounded-2xl p-8 hover-scale shadow-premium flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 text-amber-600 flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-files"><path d="M20 7h-3a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V2"/><path d="M9 18a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h7l4 4v10a2 2 0 0 1-2 2Z"/><path d="M3 7.6v12.8A1.6 1.6 0 0 0 4.6 22h9.8"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">Administrasi Menumpuk</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed font-medium">
            ATP, Prota, Prosem, Modul Ajar — semua berkas administratif wajib dibuat manual satu per satu, padahal isinya hampir sama.
          </p>
        </div>
        <span class="text-xs text-amber-500 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mt-6 block">Membosankan</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3: Waktu Keluarga Tersita -->
      <div class="bg-rose-50/30 border border-rose-100 hover:border-rose-200 rounded-2xl p-8 hover-scale shadow-premium flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-rose-100 text-rose-600 flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-home"><path d="m3 9 9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"/><polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">Waktu Keluarga Tersita</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed font-medium">
            Lembur hingga tengah malam di rumah bukan karena mendidik anak murid, melainkan demi menyelesaikan tumpukan kertas laporan.
          </p>
        </div>
        <span class="text-xs text-rose-500 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mt-6 block">Merugikan</span>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Transition & Value Props -->
    <div class="mt-20 border-t border-gray-150 pt-16">
      <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12 space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 tracking-tight">
          Dirancang untuk Guru Profesional
        </h3>
        <p class="text-base text-gray-500 font-medium">
          GuruDokAI menggabungkan kecerdasan buatan terdepan dengan kebutuhan regulasi sekolah di Indonesia.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
        <!-- AI Cerdas -->
        <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-gray-150 rounded-2xl p-6 space-y-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-primary/10 text-brand-primary flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-cpu"><rect width="16" height="16" x="4" y="4" rx="2"/><rect width="6" height="6" x="9" y="9" rx="1"/><path d="M9 1v3M15 1v3M9 20v3M15 20v3M20 9h3M20 15h3M1 9h3M1 15h3"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900">AI Cerdas</h4>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed font-medium">
            AI asisten kami memahami Kurikulum Merdeka secara mendalam dan merumuskan TP, ATP, modul ajar dengan standar akademis tinggi.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Hemat Waktu -->
        <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-gray-150 rounded-2xl p-6 space-y-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-primary/10 text-brand-primary flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-zap"><path d="M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900">Hemat Waktu</h4>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed font-medium">
            Hentikan lembur begadang. Selesaikan administrasi mingguan Anda secara cepat hanya dalam waktu kurang dari 5 menit.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Aman & Privat -->
        <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-gray-150 rounded-2xl p-6 space-y-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-primary/10 text-brand-primary flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-check"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 9.7a1 1 0 0 1-.68 0C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 .76-.97l8-2a1 1 0 0 1 .48 0l8 2A1 1 0 0 1 20 6z"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900">Aman & Privat</h4>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed font-medium">
            Seluruh data sekolah, identitas guru, dan berkas yang Anda generate terenkripsi dengan aman secara penuh dan privat.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Standar Resmi -->
        <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-gray-150 rounded-2xl p-6 space-y-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-brand-primary/10 text-brand-primary flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-award"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="7"/><path d="M8.21 13.89 7 23l5-3 5 3-1.21-9.12"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-gray-900">Standar Resmi</h4>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed font-medium">
            Dokumen yang dihasilkan mengikuti template dan standar baku nasional yang disetujui Kemendikdasmen & Kemenag.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
